        {
          "tag": "H3",
          "text": "Resolve queries faster"
        },
        {
          "tag": "H3",
          "text": "Copilot+-Give every agent an AI assistant that pulls context from past conversations, surfaces instant answers from your knowledge base, and drafts replies, so your team resolves more queries, faster."
        },
        {
          "tag": "H3",
          "text": "AI-enhanced ticketing+-Convert any conversation into a ticket with one click, automatically categorized, prioritized, and routed to the right team, so every issue reaches the right person, with full context."
        },
        {
          "tag": "H3",
          "text": "No code automations+-Build powerful automations to route conversations, manage SLAs, and configure escalation triggers, without any engineering support."
        },
        {
          "tag": "H3",
          "text": "Deliver tailored experiences across every channel"
        },
        {
          "tag": "H3",
          "text": "Engage customersat the right moment"
        },
        {
          "tag": "H3",
          "text": "Onboarding tools+-Onboard customers with interactive product tours, checklists, and in-app tooltips, so they get up to speed faster and get more value from your product, all without contacting support."
        },
        {
          "tag": "H3",
          "text": "Proactive notifications+-Keep customers informed about new features, known issues, and policy changes with in-product messages, mobile push notifications, and banners."
        },
        {
          "tag": "H3",
          "text": "Targeted messaging sequences+-Build omnichannel message journeys with a no-code visual builder, targeting customers precisely based on live behavioral data, product usage, and custom attributes."
        },
        {
          "tag": "H3",
          "text": "Monitor and improve every interaction"
        },
        {
          "tag": "H3",
          "text": "Insights+-The only solution with 100% coverage across your entire support operation, giving you actionable insights into what customers are asking, how they feel, and what's changing, with CX Score, Topics Explorer, and Trends."
        },
        {
          "tag": "H3",
          "text": "Always-on QA+-Monitor every AI and human conversation in real time, with AI-powered scoring against your custom standards and instant alerts the moment quality drops."
        },
        {
          "tag": "H3",
          "text": "Reporting+-Access pre-built reports covering every support use case, and a fully customizable report builder with advanced filters and chart visualisations."
